{"id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-oracle-machine.md","title":"Oracle 机器与查询步","display":"df-oracle-machine — Oracle 机器与查询步","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-oracle-machine","aliases":["20-df-oracle-machine"],"display":"df-oracle-machine — Oracle 机器与查询步","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 3.2.1–3.2.2；本地确定性查询元组展开","source_pdf_pages":[88,89,90],"source_printed_pages":[52,53,54],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tmcomp]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-oracle-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-oracle-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-machine — Oracle 机器与查询步"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 3.2.1–3.2.2；本地确定性查询元组展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88</span><span>89</span><span>90</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>52</span><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\circ=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(M^\\circ=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_q\\subseteq Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(Q_q\\subseteq Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0,b_1:Q_q\\to Q\">\\(b_0,b_1:Q_q\\to Q\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M^\\circ,Q_q,b_0,b_1)\">\\(M=(M^\\circ,Q_q,b_0,b_1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,c&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ}\">\\(c,c&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\">\\(t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}\">\\(\\operatorname{num}\\)</span> 是磁带与头位置上的部分函数，而不是对任意磁带位置预先赋值的全函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ},\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nt(h+n+1)=\\sqcup\\land\\forall j\\le n\\ [t(h+j)=1],\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t(h)=1,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M^A(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(q,t,h),(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\land\\Bigl[\n(q\\notin Q_q\\land(q,t,h)\\to_{M^\\circ}(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;))\\\\\n\\lor\\bigl(q\\in Q_q\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n\\land\nq&#39;=b_{\\chi_A(n)}(q)\\land t&#39;=t\\land h&#39;=h]\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ},\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nt(h+n+1)=\\sqcup\\land\\forall j\\le n\\ [t(h+j)=1],\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t(h)=1,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M^A(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(q,t,h),(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\land\\Bigl[\n(q\\notin Q_q\\land(q,t,h)\\to_{M^\\circ}(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;))\\\\\n\\lor\\bigl(q\\in Q_q\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n\\land\nq&#39;=b_{\\chi_A(n)}(q)\\land t&#39;=t\\land h&#39;=h]\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>num 的图给出原一元块长度减一的查询数。有限支撑及空白符号与 1 不同保证头下为 1 时有且仅有一个输出；头下为空白时无查询后继。查询步先取得明确的查询数，再应用对应的跳转表。普通步、查询步及正常停止输出的原约定均保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 3.2.1–3.2.2；印刷 52–54 / PDF 88–90。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M^\\circ=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"Q_q\\subseteq Q\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b_0,b_1:Q_q\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M^\\circ,Q_q,b_0,b_1)","display":false},{"tex":"c,c'\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{num}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=\\operatorname{Conf}_{M^\\circ},\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nt(h+n+1)=\\sqcup\\land\\forall j\\le n\\ [t(h+j)=1],\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ t(h)=1,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M^A(q',t',h')\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(q,t,h),(q',t',h')\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\land\\Bigl[\n(q\\notin Q_q\\land(q,t,h)\\to_{M^\\circ}(q',t',h'))\\\\\n\\lor\\bigl(q\\in Q_q\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\\n[\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n\\land\nq'=b_{\\chi_A(n)}(q)\\land t'=t\\land h'=h]\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2089,"backlinks":[{"id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-machine]] — 章 3；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-machine]]"}],"outgoing":["04aa1148d91b88f8","de14d8d6c42250de"]}